  "title": "NXP Announces Availability of Proxy Materials for the Annual General Meeting of Shareholders to Be Held on June 10, 2026",
  "summary": "EINDHOVEN, The Netherlands, April 27, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NXP Semiconductors N.V. (NASDAQ: NXPI) will hold its annual meeting of shareholders on Wednesday, June 10, 2026 at 8:30 a.m. CET at the Company’s Headquarters, High Tech Campus 60, 5656 AG, Eindhoven, The Netherlands.",
